            "detailed_description": "<h1>Check Out Jacob Jones : Episode 1!</h1><p>While you're taking a look at Episode 2, it would be a good time to remind you that you can pick up Episode 1 on Steam here <br><br></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Jacob Jones is back in Episode 2 of his Bigfoot Mystery.<br><br>Following the events of Episode 1, Jacob and Biggie set off to the spooky Crackskull Mountain to try uncover the secret of Biggies childhood. <br><br>Join the new best buddies on a brand new adventure and unravel more of the mystery in a series of brain twisting puzzles. <br><br>More crazy characters to meet, from statically charged beavers to the charming Miller and his not so charming wife.<br><br>Check out the store page for Episode 1 here<br><br>",
